// ESP32 SEWING OPERATION COUNTER + RFID CARD READER
// 1.8" ST7735 (160x128) + HW-147C (Si512 / PN512 / MFRC522-compatible)
//
// v2.3  R&D build
//  - NEW: RFID card UID is read and shown on the display (row under the header).
//      * Before the first card:  "WAITING FOR RFID"
//      * After a card is tapped: its UID stays on screen (it does NOT go back
//        to "waiting")
//      * Tap a DIFFERENT card:   the UID on screen changes to the new one
//      * Tap the SAME card again: nothing changes
//  - STYLE moved to the top-right of the FINISHED (FG) card.
//  - Everything from v2.2 is unchanged (FG counted on removal, MIN..MAX window,
//    standalone mode, OTA).
//
// Libraries: TFT_eSPI only (OTA, Wi-Fi and SPI come with the ESP32 core)
// Board: ESP32 Dev Module
// Arduino IDE: Tools > Partition Scheme must have OTA
//   ("Default 4MB with spiffs" is fine)
// Arduino IDE needs the sketch inside a folder with the same name:
//   sewing_counter_rfid/sewing_counter_rfid.ino
//
// ===== PIN MAP =====
//  TFT (in TFT_eSPI/User_Setup.h, uses the main VSPI bus):
//     MOSI 23   SCLK 26   CS 5   DC 16   RST 17   VCC 3.3V   LED 3.3V
//  RFID HW-147C (separate HSPI bus, set below):
//     SCK 14    MISO 32   MOSI 33   SS 25   VCC 3.3V (recommended)   RST/IRQ not connected
//     Switch: SW1 = OFF, SW2 = ON (SPI mode) -> unplug USB after changing it
//  IR sensor output   -> GPIO 19   (level for "garment present" = IR_ACTIVE_LEVEL below)
//  NJK-5002C output   -> optocoupler -> GPIO 34 (input-only pin: add 10k
//                        pull-up to 3.3V; idles HIGH, pulse = LOW)
//  Buzzer             -> GPIO 22
//  NEVER feed the 12-24 V NJK-5002C output straight into an ESP32 pin.
//
// OTA HOW-TO
//  1. First upload by USB cable (this puts OTA inside the device).
//  2. Device and PC on the same Wi-Fi. The IP shows on screen after boot.
//  3. Arduino IDE > Tools > Port > Network ports > "M01" (or the IP).
//  4. Upload. Password = OTA_PASSWORD below. The screen shows the progress.
// =================================================

